  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b58ed87f6d683ae4380c703929b4aac3, type: 3}
  m_Name: OnGameStarted
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameEvent
  enableDebugLogs: 0
  description: 'Raised when the game begins (after main menu, intro cutscene, etc.)


    Common
    Listeners:

    - GameManager: Initialize game state, start timer

    - UIManager:
    Show gameplay UI, hide menu

    - EnemySpawner: Begin spawning waves

    -
    MusicManager: Transition from menu music to gameplay music

    - TimerController:
    Start game timer

    - TutorialManager: Show first tutorial prompt

    - PlayerController:
    Enable player input


    Use Case:

    Marks the transition from "menu/setup"
    to "active gameplay".

    Raise this when player clicks "Start Game" or after
    intro finishes.

    Don''t confuse with scene load - this is gameplay start.'
